        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-10-16T08:54:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Moving all of these to NetProtoEnums is going to make life harder for us when we need to add a constant (we don\u0027t have OWNERS where this is defined).\n\nI get that you want the proto compiler to output these, but I\u0027m not sure we can generally afford to require the proto must be the source of truth. What happens when two components have such a requirement ?\n\nIn any case, if you want to move this I think at least it will need to go together with a change of the OWNERS file to let us add stuff in that proto.\n\nAlso, do you have a strategy to keep comments in sync when we update them ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 150,
        "startChar": 60,
        "endLine": 150,
        "endChar": 92
      },
      "revId": "7db235c3fdc0169a8169395f48e3f01f6bf7687c",
